9", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17429, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01FC18y6S8Rcwmsp8GNbHpwn", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Per runbook, rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator partial-failure error, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). A second rollback to v2.3.0 completed in all three regions. Post-rollback status: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until root-caused."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48029, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01FC18y6S8Rcwmsp8GNbHpwn", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48029, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FC18y6S8Rcwmsp8GNbHpwn", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49307, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Pv5gH8N5u4qP5UH3ESumgn", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49607, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Pv5gH8N5u4qP5UH3ESumgn", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t